  "content": "\n\n<p>此套件包含我用於生物動畫的所有 .jpm 檔案。</p>\n<p>請使用此檔案追蹤我的套件版本與哪個附加模組版本相容：[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252f1drv.ms%252fx%252fc%252f5017ea34619ff0f9%252fEYARtfWSbd1IsoYWCn7M-CkBHKTpT6MVfBMwl93LenDkAg%253fe%253ddbVTA0\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#daa520\">透過此連結</span></a>]</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1350189/description_61b8ce9e-6d91-4049-a2e0-b5557c9036e8.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"446\"></p>\n<p>歡迎將此套件作為您自製套件的相依性。&nbsp;<strong>（請勿將其直接包含在您自己的套件中）</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>使用此套件的清單：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffreshly-modded\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>[</strong><span style=\"color:#008000\"><strong>Freshly Modded</strong></span><strong>]</strong></a>（2.0.1 及以上版本），作者：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSebSemos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#daa520\">Seb_Semos</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252falex-and-steve-villagers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>[</strong><span style=\"color:#008000\"><strong>Alex and Steve Villagers</strong></span><strong>]</strong></a>（6.0.0 及以上版本），作者：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSebSemos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#daa520\">Seb_Semos</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsongs-of-war-villagers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>[</strong><span style=\"color:#008000\"><strong>Songs Of War Villagers</strong></span><strong>]</strong></a>（3.0.0 及以上版本），作者：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSebSemos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#daa520\">Seb_Semos</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fhermitcraft-villagers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>[</strong